'''Acerola''' (Japanese: '''アセロラ''' ''Acerola'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Choose 1 of your {{TCGP|Palossand}} or {{TCGP|Mimikyu}} that has damage on it, and move 40 of its damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

