==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Acerola}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Acerola]] is the [[Trial Captain|captain]] of [[Ula'ula Island]]'s abandoned {{OBP|Thrifty Megamart|Abandoned Site}} and a member of the [[Alola]] [[Elite Four]]. The Thrifty Megamart is featured in the illustration.

